  "notes": "Phyrexia: All Will Be One Commander precon, card for card (https://mtgjson.com/api/v5/decks/CorruptingInfluence_ONC.json).",
  "tags": [
    "Poison",
    "Proliferate",
    "Toxic",
    "Corrupted"
  ],
  "strategy": "Ixhel, Scion of Atraxa wins by poison rather than damage: toxic and infect creatures such as Bilious Skulldweller, Venomous Brutalizer, Ichor Rats and Blightbelly Rat put the first counters on, and Contagion Clasp, Evolution Sage, Expand the Sphere, Vat Emergence and every other proliferate card grow them. Once an opponent has three, corrupted switches on: Ixhel exiles their top card each end step for you to play, Glistening Sphere taps for three mana, Feed the Infection and Phyrexian Atlas drain them, and Glissa's Retriever and Geth's Summons pull back creatures. Vishgraz, the Doomhive, Mycosynth Fiend and Phyrexian Swarmlord grow with the table's poison, Norn's Decree turns every poisoned seat into card draw, and Ghostly Prison, Norn's Annex, Swords to Plowshares, Putrefy, Fumigate and Merciless Eviction hold the board while the counters climb toward ten.",
  "archetype": "aggro",
  "ratings": {
    "speed": 3,
    "complexity": 3,
    "interaction": 3,
    "resilience": 2,
    "pilot": 3
  },
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "ixhel_scion_of_atraxa",
      "why": "Flying, vigilance, toxic 2, and every corrupted opponent's top card is yours to play at each end step."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "vishgraz_the_doomhive",
      "why": "Three toxic Mites on arrival, and it grows by every poison counter the opponents have."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "contagion_clasp",
      "why": "A -1/-1 counter as it enters, then proliferate for {4} every turn, so three poison climbs toward ten."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "norn_s_decree",
      "why": "Every hit on you poisons the attacker, and every attack on a poisoned player draws a card."
    }
  ],
